{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_title", "source_sha256": "280aff026d5528f1d037320be9716f7b3c54b8cfc505145a5c64caed0074f13d", "ja": "真美と舞台裏", "zh": "和真美的后台之行", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f5dbd47ffebfd4c431fd1ac10e7db8d7b46500f564577352a0b573fb9ca05cf6", "ja": "真美との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是和真美在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1000_null", "source_sha256": "feb429897f130f60e04deb6dd2aada366e20c6fd144ce1eb8576051e9b8e98ff", "ja": "ツアーの宣伝のため\n真美がTVの生番組に出演した後……", "zh": "为了宣传巡演，\n真美参加电视直播节目后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "c56d27de865a779760d79eb05c4bd6258800df2cf71dbefc3bece0f740c960d8", "ja": "どったの兄ちゃん？　収録終わってから、\nなんか表情暗いよ？　女優ライトつける？", "zh": "怎么啦，哥哥？录制结束后，你的表情就一直闷闷不乐的。要不要开个补光灯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "05e204f173951dd4bddadf1ff6b97751d87a2eadf72ef5402c93e8c8d9fb9393", "ja": "あ、もしかして撮れ高足りなかった？　じつは真美も、\nもうちょいツッコめた気がしてたんだよね～。", "zh": "啊，难道是拍摄效果不够好？其实真美也觉得，自己好像还能再多吐槽几句呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1003_402cpr", "source_sha256": "1bf28704d8fb15f1a60a56f4934fde4f23eb39af0cdc8ff14702b9644b9015b6", "ja": "いや、あれ以上はいいから！　いつも以上に大御所さん\nにぐいぐい絡むから、ヒヤヒヤして疲れただけ……。", "zh": "不，可别再继续了！你比平时还要积极地去\n和大牌前辈搭话，我光是提心吊胆就累死了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1004_402cpr", "source_sha256": "ae5a591334d35be460a2b298b17ad79b800ae484d472e79313b00c17c2719b23", "ja": "まあ、盛り上がった盆栽トークの中心にいたから、\n宣伝としては満点、とも言えるけどな……。", "zh": "不过，既然成了那场热烈讨论盆景的话题中心，\n要说是宣传效果拉满，倒也说得过去就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "bcf7ae2bd0f6b76aca6af19f692591e2fff214a84ee5df84dc8d79ba566355b6", "ja": "でしょでしょ？　真美くらいになると\n「どこまでセーフか」敏感肌で分かりますからな♪", "zh": "对吧对吧？像真美这样的高手，可是能凭敏锐的肌肤感觉判断“做到什么程度还算安全”哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1006_402cpr", "source_sha256": "7cf946dcca0a4c9963c630df67e8b8f091d4bb0f926b695a85da2dd3c01fd1c9", "ja": "……肌感覚、のことか？", "zh": "……你是说，直觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "883e67f7bfd4f324174c36ef434122cf9e769e426e6d247c0c6691fbae3b0a86", "ja": "それに、この番組ってコーハイのみんなも見るっしょ？\nイイトコ見せとかないとね♪", "zh": "而且，这个节目后辈们也会看吧？不拿出好表现可不行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1008_402cpr", "source_sha256": "d051a48a671f5f8986ca5912158033e556ea5e339efff6c0d8d92ed305e2d54b", "ja": "ああ……、なるほど。\nそれで今まで以上にはりきってたわけか。", "zh": "啊……原来如此。\n所以你才会比以往更加卖力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "56bc37d6b6acfd396e707d57247f58e31be6aab5a7b70b1c591308e02d65a54f", "ja": "そゆコト！　……今回のツアーもそうだけどさ。\nこれからのお仕事とか～。", "zh": "就是这么回事！……不光是这次的巡演。\n还有今后的工作什么的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_012mam_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "996329a5e61530b05a794727c14ae46bb0714066121dae7f7e1f8964488c4739", "ja": "ステージとか、仲間とか、楽しいこととか！\n全部「今まで以上」だかんね、兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "舞台啦、伙伴啦、还有开心的事情啦！\n全部都要比“以前更加”厉害才行，哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
